        <h2 class="font-serif text-[1.5rem] font-medium lg:text-3xl lg:font-medium text-text-main-light pt-4" id="why-perfect">
          Why Shinrin-Yoku Is Perfect for Seniors Over 50
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4 my-6">
